g history before setting up event listener":[299,331],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#Common Mistakes#HIGH Fetching history before setting up event listener#{1}":[301,331],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#Common Mistakes#MEDIUM SSE ping interval >= client reconnect interval":[332,359],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#Common Mistakes#MEDIUM SSE ping interval >= client reconnect interval#{1}":[334,359],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#Common Mistakes#HIGH Sending custom headers with SSE without EventSource polyfill":[360,388],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#Common Mistakes#HIGH Sending custom headers with SSE without EventSource polyfill#{1}":[362,388],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#Common Mistakes#MEDIUM Choosing WebSocket when SSE would suffice":[389,394],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#Common Mistakes#MEDIUM Choosing WebSocket when SSE would suffice#{1}":[391,394],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#Common Mistakes#MEDIUM WebSocket subscription stale inputs on reconnect":[395,400],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#Common Mistakes#MEDIUM WebSocket subscription stale inputs on reconnect#{1}":[397,400],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#See Also":[401,407],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#See Also#{1}":[403,403],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#See Also#{2}":[404,404],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#See Also#{3}":[405,405],"#tRPC — Subscriptions#See Also#{4}":[406,407]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"name":"subscriptions","description":"Set up real-time event streams with async generator subscriptions using .subscription(async function*() { yield }). SSE via httpSubscriptionLink is recommended over WebSocket. Use tracked(id, data) from @trpc/server for reconnection recovery with lastEventId. WebSocket via wsLink and createWSClient from @trpc/client, applyWSSHandler from @trpc/server/adapters/ws. Configure SSE ping with initTRPC.create({ sse: { ping: { enabled, intervalMs } } }). AbortSignal via opts.signal for cleanup. splitLink to route subscriptions.\n","type":"core","library":"trpc","library_version":"11.14.0","requires":["server-setup","links"],"sources":["www/docs/server/subscriptions.md","www/